  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F.",
    "In a large bowl, combine chickpeas, corn, tomatoes, onion, and garlic.",
    "Add olive oil, smoked paprika, cumin, salt, and pepper; stir until coated.",
    "Transfer mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish, spreading evenly.",
    "Sprinkle feta cheese over the top and scatter bay leaves.",
    "Cover the dish with foil and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil, sprinkle chopped cilantro over the casserole.",
    "Return to oven uncovered and bake for an additional 10 minutes, or until the top is golden.",
    "Let the casserole rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot, optionally drizzle with extra olive oil or a squeeze of lemon."
